{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TetrX 360</strong>\u00a0<strong>- Eons of Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling puzzle adventure that ignites your strategic instincts! Each level pulses with vivid visuals and an electrifying soundtrack, pushing your quick thinking to the limit as you unlock quirky power-ups and conquer mind-bending challenges. With intuitive game play and endless replayability, this is an addictive experience that captivates casual gamers and puzzle enthusiasts alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetris re-imagined, enhanced and wrapped in grand story line with play modes never thought of before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TetrX 360 includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FEATURE that will make your jaw drop</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30,000+ levels (when fully deployed over the next 36 months)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thousands of variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >millions of combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >truckloads of special items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unheard of game play variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thousands of puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mind bending surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non-linear game play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiplayer challenges\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+ watch out for twists to the purchase price and in-app purchases</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/680c30dbfa6d1053bdc726004df1e001.poster.avif?t=1762416595\" width=225 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/680c30dbfa6d1053bdc726004df1e001.webm?t=1762416595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">awesome of the new blocks. hundreds more\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following initial release, in the ensuing 36 months we'll continue to add new features and levels every three months in the 1st year, every two months in the 2nd year and monthly in the 3rd year, culminating in over 30,000+ playable levels, encapsulated in a grand story that will provide entertainment for many subsequent years to come.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us to make sure you don't miss the release date.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras/a8858302f675478cfb2bcae4675ee9f5.avif?t=1762416595\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999060/extras_big/a8858302f675478cfb2bcae4675ee9f5.avif?t=1762416595 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">one of the thousands of playing fields, all different</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images are actual in-game renderings. We'll be posting more in-game images and game-play videos on a regular basis leading up to release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meantime please see video above for a random selection of art you will encounter once the full 30,000+ levels are deployed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it